(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to sell, or offer for sale, food of any type from a commissary, mobile retail food establishment, ice cream truck, pushcart or temporary food establishment without a license first having been granted under this section, except for city-sponsored events, in which a temporary nonprofit food service permit must be issued by the city.
